thub-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":80,"digest":"sha256:b4213406e59fc07c4210ad2198dbe3c4dc22c12953b54aca71ebdfa72ce0cb0f","download_count":92,"created_at":"2026-10-15T03:34:29Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T03:34:29Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/LedyBacer/ProsperoLight/releases/download/01.000.110/SHA256SUMS"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LedyBacer/ProsperoLight/tarball/01.000.110","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LedyBacer/ProsperoLight/zipball/01.000.110","body":"\n### Stable: Punktfunk hosts, more box art, no wait before the stream\n\n### New\n\n- **Punktfunk hosts:** the decoder now reserves six pictures by default, so Punktfunk's GameStream stream (five reference frames) decodes on a release build. Before, it showed no picture. Streams from other hosts are unaffected.\n- **JPEG and WebP box art:** covers that hosts such as Punktfunk pass through as JPEG or WebP now appear, as PNG covers always did.\n- **PyroWave from punktfunk:** punktfunk's PyroWave revision is accepted; its shaders and bitstream code are the same as the supported one.\n\n### Changed\n\n- **No wait before the stream:** the check for a newer version runs on its own. When homebrew.page could not be reached, starting a stream, a home-screen forwarder included, waited about a minute for that check to give up.\n- **Box art:** covers over 1 MiB load, and covers already fetched are kept in memory, so scrolling back through a large library does not download them again.\n- Built on ps5-opengl SDK 1.0.2.\n\n### Installation / update\n\nTitle ID remains `PPSA99002`; saved PCs, settings and pairing are kept. Close the app before updating. Extract `PPSA99002.zip` and copy the complete `PPSA99002/` folder to `/data/homebrew/`. Keep only one installation for this title. `SHA256SUMS` verifies the download.\n\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LedyBacer/ProsperoLight/releases/413391530/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}}